abstract: >-
  Deterministic reproducibility code for a regional gravitational phase framework
  for dark-sector phenomenology, including phase-transition diagnostics,
  regional matter–geometry selectors, basin hierarchy tests, interface dynamics,
  geometric active-charge calculations, SPARC diagnostics, and a 3D synthetic
  watershed stress test.
keywords:
  - dark matter
  - dark energy
  - emergent gravity
  - phase transitions
  - cosmic web
  - galaxy dynamics
  - reproducible research
